ParWasClean|BOOL|True if the connection was cleanly closed' />
					<property name='OnReceiveString' target='macOnReceiveString' typeid='24' hidden='0' locked='0' info='Called when a string-based WebSocket message is received' filter='NamOnWebSocketRxString
