ParMessage|STRING|The message received
ParEvent|HANDLE|Optional information about the received data' />
					<property name='OnReceiveArray' target='macOnReceiveArray' typeid='24' hidden='0' locked='0' info='Called when an array-based WebSocket message is received' filter='NamOnWebSocketRxArray
DesCalled when a WebSocket array message is received
ParArray[256]|BYTE|The data received
ParSize|INT|The size of the received array
ParEvent|HANDLE|Optional information about the received data' />
					<property name='OnError' target='macOnError' typeid='24' hidden='0' locked='0' info='Called when a WebSocket error occurs
' filter='NamOnWebSocketError
DesCalled when a WebSocket error occurs
